    "answer": {
      "short": "$84$",
      "worked": "Choose the 6 positions for the heads; the remaining 3 positions are tails.\n$$\\begin{aligned}N&=\\binom{9}{6}\\\\&=\\frac{9!}{6!3!}\\\\&=84\\end{aligned}$$",
